# liteDS-v2 input script - Shrek Smash n' Crash Racing IN-RACE gameplay workload.
#
# Drives from direct boot through the button-only menu path into a live Quick
# Race, then holds A (accelerate) for the rest of the run. Unlike the boot/menu
# workload (600f, no input), this exercises live 3D rasterization, GXFIFO and
# DMA every frame - the real gameplay hot path.
#
# Milestones (PPM-verified, software renderer, FreeBIOS direct boot, fixed RTC):
#   ~900   main menu, "Single Player" highlighted
#   ~960   SELECT GAME TYPE (Tournament highlighted); DOWN,DOWN -> Quick Race
#   ~1080  QUICK RACE track select ("Swamp" default) -> A
#   ~1150  SELECT CHARACTER ("Shrek" default)         -> A
#   ~1230  SELECT PROFILE ("DEFAULT")                 -> A
#   ~1320  "Loading..."
#   ~1560  RACE LIVE: HUD "1st"/"Lap 1/3", P1-P4 list, minimap, live 3D
#   1600   race-start reference frame F (savestate dump point); kart at line
#   1600+  A held: kart accelerates; race timer runs; AI karts race (minimap)
#
# No touchscreen input is used or required to reach the race - the whole menu
# path is button-playable. Format: "<frame> <keys>" holds those keys from that
# frame onward (level, not edge). Keys: A B SELECT START RIGHT LEFT UP DOWN R L X Y.

# --- menu navigation ---
900 A
910 NONE
970 DOWN
980 NONE
990 DOWN
1000 NONE
1010 A
1020 NONE
1080 A
1090 NONE
1150 A
1160 NONE
1230 A
1240 NONE
# --- race: hold A (accelerate) from race start to end of run ---
1540 A
